    "tag": "0.3.1",
    "title": "DroidDeck 0.3.1",
    "summary": "\u2022 Decky plugins can be imported from ZIP files, with remote binaries verified and installed copies of the same plugin replaced. (@xXJSONDeruloXx, #79)\n\u2022 Steam's Internet page shows Android Wi-Fi and cellular connections. Optional Wi-Fi discovery adds network names and nearby networks with Android's Location permission. (@xXJSONDeruloXx, #150)\n\u2022 Paste text from the Android clipboard into Steam sessions. (@xXJSONDeruloXx, #151)\n\u2022 The Proton selected in Components stays in sync with Steam's default compatibility tool, and runnable builds are marked Compatible. Windows titles with a Valve recommendation use that default unless you choose another compatible tool for the game. (@maxjivi05, #197, #224)",
