      "summary": "On an AYANEO Pocket FIT (Adreno 750) the Components page showed \"Adreno\" and warned \"Below tested hardware (Adreno 725 and newer): it may not run\". Its kernel names the GPU Adreno33v2 (KGSL gpumodel), GpuInfo needs a three-digit model, and Android's SoC model is blank \u2014 so the model was unknown and the card fell back to the untested warning. Handhelds often leave these fields empt",
